{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"feb08b9a448a6d8849ead791b305b99aa373ff61cc0aae0e1cd0cc54993789dc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["谴责不诚恳的禁食"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大流士王第四年九月，就是基斯流月初四日，耶和华的话临到撒迦利亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时伯特利人已经打发沙利色和利坚米勒，并跟从他们的人，去恳求耶和华的恩，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["并问万军之耶和华殿中的祭司和先知说：「我历年以来，在五月间哭泣斋戒，现在还当这样行吗？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["万军之耶和华的话就临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「你要宣告国内的众民和祭司，说：『你们这七十年，在五月、七月禁食悲哀，岂是丝毫向我禁食吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你们吃喝，不是为自己吃，为自己喝吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["当耶路撒冷和四围的城邑有居民，正兴盛，南地高原有人居住的时候，耶和华借从前的先知所宣告的话，你们不当听吗？』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["被掳的原因是悖逆"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华的话又临到撒迦利亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「万军之耶和华曾对你们的列祖如此说：『要按至理判断，各人以慈爱怜悯弟兄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不可欺压寡妇、孤儿、寄居的，和贫穷人。谁都不可心里谋害弟兄。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他们却不肯听从，扭转肩头，塞耳不听，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["使心硬如金钢石，不听律法和万军之耶和华用灵借从前的先知所说的话。故此，万军之耶和华大发烈怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["万军之耶和华说：「我曾呼唤他们，他们不听；将来他们呼求我，我也不听！"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我必以旋风吹散他们到素不认识的万国中。这样，他们的地就荒凉，甚至无人来往经过，因为他们使美好之地荒凉了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEC/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}